#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:0
msgid ""
"Add further languages to Ubuntu Desktop, including translations, "
"dictionaries and other language support components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:7
msgid "Topics: Software Customization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:11
msgid "Install languages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:13
msgid ""
"When you install Ubuntu, the language that you select in the installer gets "
"installed, together with English. You can add further languages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:15
msgid ""
"In addition to the user interface translations, installing a new language "
"also enables various language support components such as dictionaries for "
"spell checking, fonts and input methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:18
msgid ""
"Some translations may be incomplete, and certain applications may not "
"support your language at all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:21
msgid "Open the *Language Support* application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:23
msgid "You can search for it in the Activities overview."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:25
msgid ""
"You can also access the application from {menuselection}`Settings --> System "
"--> Region & Language --> Manage Installed Languages`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:27
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Install / Remove Languages…`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:29
msgid ""
"The Installed Languages window lists all the available languages, with the "
"currently installed languages checked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:31
msgid ""
"Check the languages that you want to install, and uncheck those currently "
"installed languages that you want to remove."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:33
msgid "Click {guilabel}`Apply`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/install-languages.md:35
msgid ""
"Enter your password, or the password for the requested administrator account."
msgstr ""
